  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Capital works on road, rail, wharfs, bridge and culvert work at Mombasa port and associated cargo handling areas.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Capital works on road, rail, wharfs, bridge and culvert work at Mombasa port and associated cargo handling areas. is a component of Kenya - Strengthening Regional Economic Integration reported by FCDO with a funding type of 111 - Not for profit organisation and a budget of &#xa3;25,950,000. It works in the following sector(s): Business policy and administration, Trade facilitation, Regional trade agreements (RTAs), Multilateral trade negotiations, Trade policy and administrative management.</narrative>
  </description>
